Third-party components
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The platform runs alongside, but does not embed, the following. Each keeps its
own licence and its own notices:

  Temporal            MIT          durable orchestration (server and Python SDK)
  LiteLLM             MIT          model gateway (container image)
  PostgreSQL          PostgreSQL   database (container image)
  Ecphoria            Apache-2.0   optional memory service (container image)

Python and JavaScript dependencies are declared in uv.lock and
apps/web/pnpm-lock.yaml, and an SBOM ships with every release image.
